{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zep-3-1","title":"Zephaniah 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A sharp reproof of Jerusalem for divers sins. 8 An exhortation to wait for the restoration of Israel, 14 and to rejoice for their salvation by God.</p>\n<p>her that is filthy. or, gluttonous. Heb. craw. Le 1:16 to the. Isa 5:7; 30:12; 59:13; Jer 6:6; 22:17; Eze 22:7,29; Am 3:9; 4:1 Mic 2:2; Zec 7:10; Mal 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-2","title":"Zephaniah 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>obeyed. De 28:15-68; Ne 9:26; Jer 7:23-28; 22:21; Zec 7:11-14 she received. Isa 1:5; Jer 2:30; 5:3; Eze 24:13 correction. or, instruction. Ps 50:17; Pr 1:7; 5:12; Jer 32:33; 35:13,17; Joh 3:18,19 she trusted. Ps 78:22; Isa 30:1-3; 31:1; Jer 17:5,6 she drew. Ps 10:4; Isa 29:13; 43:22; Heb 10:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-3","title":"Zephaniah 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>princes. Job 4:8-11; Ps 10:8-10; Pr 28:15; Isa 1:23; Jer 22:17 Eze 22:6,25-27; Mic 3:1-4,9-11 evening. Jer 5:6; Hab 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-4","title":"Zephaniah 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>light. Isa 9:15; 56:10-12; Jer 5:31; 6:13,14; 8:10; 14:13-15; 23:9-17,25-27 Jer 23:32; 27:14,15; La 2:14; Eze 13:3-16; Ho 9:7; Mic 2:11; 3:5,6 Mt 7:15; 2Co 11:13; 2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 4:1; Re 19:20 her priests. 1Sa 2:12-17,22; Eze 22:26; 44:7,8; Ho 4:6-8; Mal 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-5","title":"Zephaniah 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>just. De 32:4; Ps 99:3,4; 145:17; Ec 3:16,17; Isa 45:21; Hab 1:3; Zec 9:9 Ro 3:26; 1Pe 1:17 is in. 15,17; De 23:14; Isa 12:6; Eze 48:35; Mic 3:11; Zec 2:5 he will. Ge 18:25; Job 8:3; 34:10,17-19 every morning. Heb. morning by morning. Isa 28:19; 33:2; 50:4; Jer 21:12; La 3:23 bring. Ps 37:6; Isa 42:3,4; Mic 7:9; Lu 12:2; Ro 2:5; 1Co 4:5 but. Jer 3:3; 6:15; 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-6","title":"Zephaniah 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>cut. Isa 10:1-34; 15:1-16:14; 19:1-25; 37:11-13,24-26,36; Jer 25:9-11 Jer 25:18-26; Na 2:1-3:19; 1Co 10:6,11 towers. or, corners.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-7","title":"Zephaniah 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Surely. 2; Isa 5:4; 63:8; Jer 8:6; 36:3; Lu 19:42-44; 2Pe 3:9 so. Jer 7:7; 17:25-27; 25:5; 38:17 howsoever. 2Ch 28:6-8; 32:1,2; 33:11; 36:3-10 they. Mic 2:1,2 corrupted. Ge 6:12; De 4:16; Ho 9:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-8","title":"Zephaniah 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>wait. Ps 27:14; 37:7,34; 62:1,5; 123:2; 130:5,6; Pr 20:22; Isa 30:18 La 3:25,26; Ho 12:6; Mic 7:7; Jas 5:7,8 rise. Ps 12:5; 78:65,66; Isa 42:13,14; 59:16-18 to gather. Eze 38:14-23; Joe 3:2,9-16; Mic 4:11-13; Zec 14:2,3; Mt 25:32 Re 16:14; 19:17-19 for all. 1:18; De 32:21,22; So 8:6; Eze 36:5,6; 38:19; 2Pe 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-9","title":"Zephaniah 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>will. Isa 19:18; Mt 12:35; Eph 4:29 language. Heb. lip. Ge 11:1; *marg: that. 1Ki 8:41-43; Ps 22:27; 86:9,10; 113:3; Jer 16:19; Hab 2:14; Zec 2:11 Zec 8:20-23; 14:9; Ac 2:4-13; Ro 15:6-11; Re 11:15 consent. Heb. shoulder.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-10","title":"Zephaniah 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ps 68:31; 72:8-11; Isa 11:11; 18:1,7-19:15; 27:12,13; 49:20-23 Isa 60:4-12; 66:18-21; Mal 1:11; Ac 8:27; 24:17; Ro 11:11,12; 15:16 1Pe 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-11","title":"Zephaniah 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>shalt thou. 19,20; Ps 49:5; Isa 45:17; 54:4; 61:7; 65:13,14; Joe 2:26,27; Ro 9:33 1Pe 2:6 that rejoice. Nu 16:3; Isa 48:1,2; Jer 7:4,9-12; Eze 7:20-24; 24:21; Mic 3:11 Mt 3:9; Ro 2:17 because of my holy. or, in my holy. Ps 87:1,2; Isa 11:9; Da 9:16,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-12","title":"Zephaniah 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>leave. Isa 14:32; 61:1-3; Zec 11:11; 13:8,9; Mt 5:3; 11:5; 1Co 1:27,28 Jas 2:5 and. Ps 37:40; Isa 50:10; Na 1:7; Mt 12:21; Ro 15:12; Eph 1:12,13 1Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-13","title":"Zephaniah 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>remnant. 2:7; Isa 6:13; 10:20-22; Mic 4:7; Ro 11:4-7 not. Isa 11:6-9; 35:8; 60:21; Jer 31:33; Eze 36:25-27; Joe 3:17,21 Zec 14:20,21; Mt 13:41; 1Jo 3:9,10; 5:18 nor. Isa 63:8; Joh 1:47; Col 3:9; Re 14:5; 21:8,27 they. Ps 23:2; Isa 65:10; Jer 23:4; Eze 34:13-15,23-28; Mic 4:4; 5:4,5 Mic 7:14; Re 7:15-17 and. Isa 17:2; 54:14; Jer 30:10; Eze 39:26; 1Pe 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-14","title":"Zephaniah 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>shout. Ezr 3:11-13; Ne 12:43; Ps 14:7; 47:5-7; 81:1-3; 95:1,2; 100:1,2 Ps 126:2,3; Isa 12:6; 24:14-16; 35:2; 40:9; 42:10-12; 51:11; 54:1 Isa 65:13,14,18,19; Jer 30:19; 31:13; 33:11; Zec 2:10,11; 9:9,10 Zec 9:15-17; Mt 21:9; Lu 2:10-14; Re 19:1-6 O daughter of Jerusalem. Mic 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-15","title":"Zephaniah 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>hath taken. Ge 30:23; Ps 85:3; Isa 25:8; 40:1,2; 51:22; Mic 7:18-20; Zec 1:14-16 Zec 8:13-15; 10:6,7 he hath. Isa 13:1-14:32; Jer 50:1-51:64; Mic 7:10,16,17; Hab 2:8,17 Zec 2:8,9; 12:3; Ro 8:33,34; Re 12:10 the king. Isa 33:22; Eze 37:24,25; Zec 9:9; Joh 1:49; 12:15; 19:19; Re 19:16 is in. 5,17; Eze 37:26-28; 48:35; Joe 3:20,21; Re 7:15; 21:3,4 thou. Isa 35:10; 51:22; 60:18; 65:19; Eze 39:29; Joe 3:17; Am 9:15 Zec 14:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-16","title":"Zephaniah 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>be said. Isa 35:3,4; 40:9; 41:10,13,14; 43:1,2; 44:2; 54:4; Jer 46:27,28 Hag 2:4,5; Zec 8:15; Joh 12:12; Heb 12:12 slack. or, faint. 2Co 4:1; Ga 6:9; Eph 3:13; Heb 12:3-5; Re 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-17","title":"Zephaniah 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>in the. 5,15 is mighty. Ge 17:1; 18:14; Ps 24:8-10; Isa 9:6; 12:2,6; 63:12; Heb 7:25 will rejoice. Nu 14:8; De 30:9; Ps 147:11; 149:4; Isa 62:4,5; 65:19; Jer 32:41 Lu 15:5,6,23,24,32; Joh 15:11 he will. Ge 1:31; 2:2; Isa 18:4; Joh 13:1 rest. Heb. be silent.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-18","title":"Zephaniah 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>gather. 20; Jer 23:3; 31:8,9; Eze 34:13; 36:24; Ho 1:11; Ro 11:25,26 sorrowful. Ps 42:2-4; 43:3; 63:1,2; 84:1,2; 137:3-6; La 1:4,7; 2:6,7; Ho 9:5 the reproach of it was a burden. Heb. the burden upon it wasreproach.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-19","title":"Zephaniah 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I will undo. 15; Isa 25:9-12; 26:11; 41:11-16; 43:14-17; 49:25,26; 51:22,23 Isa 66:14-16; Jer 30:16; 46:28; 51:35,36; Eze 39:17-22; Joe 3:2-9 Mic 7:10; Na 1:11-14; Zec 2:8,9; 12:3,4; 14:2,3; Re 19:17-21; 20:9 and I will save. Jer 31:8; Eze 34:16; Mic 4:6,7; Heb 12:13 and I will. Isa 60:14; 61:7; 62:7; Jer 33:9; Eze 39:26 get them praise. Heb. set them for a praise. where they havebeen put to shame. Heb. of their shame.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-3-20","title":"Zephaniah 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>even. Isa 11:11,12; 27:12,13; 56:8; Eze 28:25; 34:16; 37:21; 39:28; Am 9:14 for. 19; Isa 60:15; 61:9; 62:7,12; Mal 3:12 I turn. Ps 35:6; Jer 29:14; Eze 16:53; Joe 3:1</p>"}]}